<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. forces are now operating alongside Ecuadorian troops and have redeployed MQ-9 Reaper drones from Africa to support operations in Colombia and Ecuador, while U.S. anti-drug strikes at sea have begun seizing crews and blowing up boats, extending violence to the maritime domain. Ecuadorian forces captured four border commandos accused of killing soldiers and increased cooperation with Peru to combat illegal mining that funds organized crime. European and Ecuadorian police cooperation resulted in 20 arrests in a major drug-trafficking bust, and nightly curfews are imposed across Ecuador from November 1 to 10 under a declared state of emergency. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQOFNadFNYUmxmMWNMeTRqdzc5aWhiTjVxOUxNWUppZjFoYzlHRkhBUWFFTmFDNF90VEowRTd0TGR2ZW1pWW1seUFlSUpMYTVkTzljdEVGVDFjRXBfak9fZm5iSEJ6UjlYbjI2YThveWw5NlpBY1M3ZU9zTFdJNEVqakI3Vnc0aThuU2xCWGtxckh5ZC1XOVlOb2FMMlRILWFVV3lsRDlHUW9teXJLSEhJQ0FWVkpPUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOa2F3LWJ6X2JsMUJCbmtaVy1wanVPODZ1cllabmJUdlZqd3ItUXNvdUM5ZkxHcEVjdnhxZmtIbkRzdnRyemt3MGlkaWxVX1hpNDRzUlpfT19wMU4yU3RxVW5lTVhmU19OcEoxNVdwdEtwZ3dDdVhmVXBUdFNvLVE0NFlPc3ZWNnZKOW9JeXRIdzZyWTdxZjByeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxONmIwdTBVUy1zSVVLdDk4SUU1TjJRbjQ0amlIaUhkX3BlTlpRblpRR2dlZjMtb2JGSEdqNUxsc0hPV2FWenFJNDJxV2thaktiWGZMbm43TEtSVXoxYmJlSUk3NVdNYjEwajFqc2VEMjBqVWZ1ZUdIRTdGZnlNYnlUUkEyaWNwMzVFdUZsd1VGeTI2djZ3MGNWa0xfLVJiaFRLcHJERmNPeTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Batesville Dai